["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">機</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>机器；机会；飞机；织机；效能</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はた</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">飛行機</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひこうき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">飞机；航空器</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">機会</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">机会</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">機械</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">机器；机械装置；仪器；器具；装置</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">平</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>平坦；和平；平常；平等；平定</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘイ・ビョウ・ヒョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たい.ら・たい.らげる・ひら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">公平</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうへい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">公平；公正；正义；客观</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">平ら</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">平坦；平；水平；光滑；平静；安宁；平和；镇定；稳定；（坐姿）随意；放松地坐；舒适（多作「お平らに」）；高原；台地；平原</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">平等</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">びょうどう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">平等；公平；均等</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">加</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>添加；增加；加入；包含；加拿大</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くわ.える・くわ.わる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">加減</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かげん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">程度；范围；分量；平衡；状态；情况；（身体）状况；健康状态；调整；节制；调节；加法和减法；略有……的迹象；略带……的样子；恰好适合……</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">参加</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">参加；参与；加入</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">増加</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぞうか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">增加；上升；增长；添加；增量</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">受</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>接受；承受；获得；接（电话）；通过（考试）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">う.ける・-う.け・う.かる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">受付</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うけつけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">接待处；前台；接待员；咨询员；受理；接收</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">受ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">接收；获得；接住；接球；受到（风吹、浪打、日晒等）；迎着（风浪）；沐浴（阳光）；承受（损害）；遭受（损失）；受（伤）；感受（影响）；接受（手术等）；参加（考试）；应（战）；被赋予；天生具有（生命、才能等）；觉得有趣；感到好笑；被逗乐；继承；传承；出身于；面向；朝向（南方等）；受…修饰；赎回；取回（当物等）；受欢迎；流行；叫座</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">受け取る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うけとる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">收到；接收；接受；理解；解释；领会</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">続</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>继续；连续；后续</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゾク・ショク・コウ・キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つづ.く・つづ.ける・つぐ.ない</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">続く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つづく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">继续；持续；进行；连续；不间断；反复发生；一再出现；通向；连接；相邻；接续；跟随；接在……之后；位列其次；坚持；维持；持续</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">続ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つづける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">继续</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">相続</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そうぞく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">继承；接任；继承；继受</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">進</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>前进；促进；进展</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すす.む・すす.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">進む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すすむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">前进；向前移动；领先；走在前面；取得进展；进步；加深；加剧；（时钟）走快；超前；自愿；主动做</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">進学</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんがく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">升学；升入（高中、大学等）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">進歩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんぽ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">进步；进展；改进；发展</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">数</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>数量；计数；若干；屡次；命运</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">スウ・ス・サク・ソク・シュ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かず・かぞ.える・しばしば・せ.める・わずらわ.しい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=