" lang=\"ja\">さす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">指；指向；提名；选定；指定人选；识别；表示；指出；下将棋；走棋（移动棋子）；伸直手臂向前（舞蹈动作）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">権</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>权力；权利；权威</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケン・ゴン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おもり・かり・はか.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">権利</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けんり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">权利；特权</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">権</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">权利；权（做某事的权利）；权力；权限；权势</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">棄権</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きけん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">弃权；放弃权利；退赛</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">支</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>支撑；支持；分支；支付；妨碍</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ささ.える・つか.える・か.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">支度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">したく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">准备；筹备；安排</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">支給</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">供给；供应；支付；津贴；补助</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">支出</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ししゅつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">支出；支付；开支</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">産</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</