s=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">責任</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せきにん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">职责；责任（含对下属的监督责任）；责任；义务</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">任せる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まかせる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">委托；交付；托付；听任；任凭；听之任之；充分利用；尽情使用；毫无保留地使用</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">就任</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうにん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">就任；上任；就职；赴任</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">引</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>拉；引导；引用；减去；撤退</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひ.く・ひ.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">字引</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じびき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">字典</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">引く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">拉；拖；牵（马等）；吸引；引起；缩回；收缩；摸牌；抽牌；画；划；感冒；着凉；弹奏；演奏；查阅；查找；查询；拉（车）；拖（车辆）；牵引（车辆）；减去；扣除；退潮；褪去；淡去；是……的后代；继承（血统、特征）；引用；援引；举证；接通；安装；供应；拖长（音）；延长（声音）；涂；抹；打蜡；退后；后退；后缩；减弱；消退；消肿；辞职；退休；离职；反感；倒胃口；（觉得）尴尬</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">引き出し</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひきだし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抽屉；提取；取款；应变知识；临机应变的本领</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">求</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>请求；要求；需求；追求；征求</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キュウ・グ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もと.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">請求</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">请求；要求；索赔；申请；收费；开账单；请款</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">要求</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ようきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">要求；请求；需求；所需</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">求める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もとめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">要求；寻求</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">所</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>场所；范围</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ところ・-ところ・どころ・とこ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">所</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ところ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">地方；场所；地点；场景；住址；地址；地区；区域；地域；家；住处；方面；角度；侧面；段落；篇章；部分；空间；余地；事情；事物；于是；结果；因此；即将；正要；正在做；刚做完；刚才做；大约；左右；前后</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">台所</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だいどころ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">厨房；灶间；财务状况；经济情况</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">近所</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きんじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邻近；附近；周围</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">次</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>其次；顺序；下一个</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジ・シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ.ぐ・つぎ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">次</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">下一；其次；（化学）次（表示含低价元素，如次氯酸）；次；回；序；顺序</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">次第</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しだい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">取决于；根据；一……就……；……后立即；按照；无论什么；顺序；程序；次序；情况；经过；事态；原因；理由</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">次々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つぎつぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">依次；逐个；陆续</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">昨</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>昨天；之前</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">昨日</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きのう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">昨天；前一天</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">昨夜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうべ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">昨晚；昨天傍晚</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">一昨日</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おととい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">前天</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">論</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>议论；争论；讨论</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あげつら.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">議論</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎろん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">议论；讨论；争论；辩论</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">結論</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けつろん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">结论；（论证、讨论、研究等的）结论；（逻辑）结论（由前提推出的命题）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">論争</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろんそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">争论；争议；辩论；论战</span></li></ul></div></li>"]